1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:02,740
Never been one for talking

2
00:00:04,100 --> 00:00:06,260
Just to hear the sound

3
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:10,500
If I say it, I'll back it

4
00:00:11,380 --> 00:00:14,740
Every step on the ground

5
00:00:14,740 --> 00:00:17,300
I don't swear on anything

6
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:21,540
Don't need a handshake or a pen

7
00:00:21,540 --> 00:00:24,900
Every word I say I mean

8
00:00:25,060 --> 00:00:28,820
Ask anybody who's my friend

9
00:00:28,820 --> 00:00:32,020
They counted my days

10
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:34,500
So I made the days count

11
00:00:35,700 --> 00:00:38,580
Every morning I wake up

12
00:00:39,140 --> 00:00:42,020
Is the word I'm living out

13
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:42,920
I said I'd fight my hardest
